sequenceDiagram
    title Logical sequence - Sign in (POST /auth/login)
    participant Client
    participant RateLimiter
    participant AuthRouter
    participant ZodSchema
    participant Security
    participant Repository
    participant PostgreSQL
    Client->>RateLimiter: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    RateLimiter->>AuthRouter: within 20 per 15 min
    AuthRouter->>ZodSchema: parse email, password
    ZodSchema-->>AuthRouter: valid credentials object
    AuthRouter->>Repository: withTx(system)
    Repository->>PostgreSQL: SELECT user FOR UPDATE
    PostgreSQL-->>Repository: id, role, status, hash, locked_until
    Repository->>Security: verifyPassword argon2id or bcrypt
    Security-->>Repository: match or no match
    Repository->>PostgreSQL: on failure: failed_login_count + 1, lock at 5
    Repository->>PostgreSQL: on success: reset count, rehash, INSERT audit signed_in
    Repository->>PostgreSQL: INSERT user_sessions with refresh token hash
    Repository->>Security: signAccessToken sub and role, 15 min
    Security-->>AuthRouter: access and refresh tokens
    AuthRouter-->>Client: 200 tokens and user, or 401, 403, 423
